'''Karmine Corp''' (previously known as '''Kameto Corp''') and occasionally abbreviated as '''KCorp''' or '''KC''' is a [[:Category:France|French]] organisation which currently plays in the [[LEC]].

On October 18th, 2023, '''Karmine Corp''' announced the acquisition of the [[LEC|League of Legends EMEA Championship]] slot of '''[[Astralis]]'''. <ref>{{cite web |url=https://x.com/KarmineCorp/status/1714704130755661937 |title=La Karmine Corp évoluera en #LEC dès la saison 2024. |date=2023-10-18 |author=[[Karmine Corp]] |language={{Flag|fr}} French}}</ref>

